WEBVTT

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.000
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.800
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.640
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:03.910
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.880
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:09.750
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.650
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:15.550
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:22.960
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:25.060
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:28.830
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:32.840
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:35.410
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.580
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:41.450
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:47.720
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:48.620
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:51.320
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:54.130
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:57.030
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:58.600
<i>Together we are</i>

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.670
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:07.630
Mepo?

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:07.630
Mipo?

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:07.630
Popo?

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:09.700
Seeds?

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:11.000
That's right...

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:18.310
I saw Jyaku-King spreading seeds 
toward the Field of Rainbows.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:27.850
The seeds will blossom, and start 
sucking up all the nutrition

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:30.290
from the Field of Rainbows as they grow.

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:32.230
How could he...?

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:35.870
We don't know what they will do as they grow.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:37.600
That's so frightening.

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:41.350
At this rate, the Field of 
Rainbows will eventually...

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:43.720
That can't be mepo!

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:48.090
They're the only ones who can stop this...

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:49.450
Mipo!

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:50.920
Who are "they"?

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:53.380
The legendary warriors.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.340
The legendary warriors?

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:59.100
What were the names of those 
legendary warriors again?

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:00.430
Pretty Cure mepo!

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:03.620
That's right... Pretty Cula.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:06.630
It's Pretty Cure mepo!

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:09.560
That's what I said... Pretty Cula.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:11.460
PRETTY CURE mepo!

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.780
I have it now! Pretty Cula!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.970
It's no use.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:17.600
Pollun...?

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:18.810
Popo?

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.210
Go to the Field of Rainbows...

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.280
To Pretty Cure.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:25.040
Mepo!

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:25.040
Mipo!

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:27.150
Mepple? Mipple?

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.300
Take care of Pollun.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.300
Mepo!

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.300
Mipo!

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.070
You may not realize this yet, Pollun...

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:37.950
But you have an amazing power.

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:41.620
I'm sure you'll be of great help to everyone.

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:46.440
And you'll guide us to the 
future with your powers.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:49.340
Popo...

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:52.340
Everyone needs you.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.270
Now go...

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.010
Chosen Guardian Mepple?

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:58.030
Mepo!

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.230
Princess of Hope Mipple?

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:01.220
Mipo!

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:04.970
Prince of Light, who will 
guide us to the future Pollun?

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:05.970
Popo!

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:14.000
"A NEW DARKNESS CLOSES IN! 
SAVE THE LOST POLLUN"

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:18.300
So that's why you came back here...

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:21.530
I think I understand, or maybe I don't...

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:25.630
In other words, it didn't end there, did it?

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:55.140
Now that Pollun's here, you have 
nothing to worry about popo.

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.600
I certainly hope so.

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:00.900
But I'm happy to see both of you again mipo.

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.880
That's true... I thought we'd 
never see each other again.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.850
You'll be taking care of 
us again from today mepo.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.080
You're kidding! Are you serious?

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:12.970
Don't pretend that you hate it...

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:17.770
I bet you missed me so much that 
you couldn't sleep at night mepo.

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:18.990
I'm right, aren't I mepo?

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:22.130
Of course... NOT!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:22.970
Mepo!

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:26.220
Are you sure that was the right thing to do?

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.700
Let's leave it up to Pretty Cure.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.540
That's our only choice.

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:31.670
That's true.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:36.920
The seeds he spread were 
like a part of Jyaku-King.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:41.650
With that, Jyaku-King will 
come back to life, won't he?

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.950
Do you think so?

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:48.600
That say isn't that far away.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:53.130
I wonder what those seeds 
were that Jyaku-King spread.

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:55.520
Those seeds are supposed to sprout, but...

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.050
I'm tired popo.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.400
That's because you're 
always in that form mepo.

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:07.110
But it's easier to move like this popo.

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:10.470
I always stayed like this 
on the Field of Light popo.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:12.400
But this is the Field of Rainbows mipo.

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:15.100
So you can't stay in that 
form for every long mipo.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.120
I'm fine popo!

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:21.830
Pull yourself together!

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.330
He's sleeping mipo.

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.730
What's with this kid?

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:33.200
They're waking up popo.

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:34.700
Mepo!

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:34.700
Mipo!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.700
They're waking up popo.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:38.930
Waking up?

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:40.220
What are you talking about anyway?

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:41.950
You're already awake.

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:43.730
They're growing popo.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:45.080
Growing?

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:47.010
I don't know what you mean!

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.970
I don't know either popo.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.060
Here's the proposal you asked for.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.160
You've already finished it?

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:11.060
It's just like you, Kakuzawa...

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.140
You're as fast as ever, aren't you?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.420
Nagisa! You have a phone 
call from Yukishiro-san.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.220
How long are you going to sleep?

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.690
What do you mean Pollun's gone?

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:30.250
He went off on his own.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.280
Okay... I'll be right over.

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:35.060
He sure knows how to cause trouble.

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.200
Who are you talking about?

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:41.510
Stop butting into other people's 
business all the time!

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:43.360
Mom!

00:07:57.860 --> 00:07:58.580
Popo!

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:06.340
Popo... Popo... Popo!

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:11.520
I got one!

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.020
It's so cute!

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:14.940
But something's strange about this one.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:16.300
Popo!

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:17.810
It talked!

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:23.810
Hey! Where are you, Pollun?

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:25.170
He's not here.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.110
This isn't the Field of Light...

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.740
So Pollun can't go very far mepo.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.330
Shall we split up, and look for him?

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.250
Maybe we should.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.650
What a surprise popo.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:54.500
Popo! Popo! Popo!

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.300
I thought I was going to die popo.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.000
How did it go?

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.280
I couldn't find him.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.690
What are we going to do?

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:15.490
I wonder where Pollun would go anyway.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:19.300
Pollun is full of curiosity mipo...

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:24.070
So anything he sees on the Field of 
Rainbows will be of interest to him mipo.

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:26.590
He sure is a lot of trouble mepo.

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:30.040
Pollun's a little kid, so 
what he'd like best is...

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:30.710
What?

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:34.320
The bakery, of course!

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:35.780
The bakery?

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:36.780
I'm sure of it.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:39.490
Can you be so sure mepo?

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:41.550
When I was little,

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:45.330
I wouldn't budge from the bakery 
until my mom bought me something.

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:48.450
So you were a handful since 
you were little mepo.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:49.960
Be quiet!

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:53.040
In any case, let's give it a try.

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.670
Mepple!

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:00.330
Mipple!

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.150
Where are you popo?

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:09.420
They're waking up popo.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:19.940
<i>The typhoon is gathering strength 
as it advances northward...</i>

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:24.520
We're supposed to golf this 
weekend... Give me a break.

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:34.480
Are these the pictures from 
the last company trip?

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.560
Everyone looks like they're 
having fun, aren't they?

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.540
What is this group picture?

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.250
Only half of us are in the picture.

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:42.350
Look at Kakuzawa-kun...

00:10:42.650 --> 00:10:46.400
Everyone else is smiling, and 
he's the only one with a frown.

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:50.970
What is Kakuzawa-kun doing anyway?

00:10:56.940 --> 00:11:02.130
<i>The typhoon is changing directions 
and moving toward the east,</i>

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:04.270
<i>going toward the Pacific.</i>

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:07.110
He had me scared for a while...

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.740
What's wrong, Kakuzawa?

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:24.390
Kakuzawa?

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:59.440
<i>This large and very powerful typhoon</i>

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:00.710
What is this group picture?

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:05.280
<i>suddenly changed directions and is heading 
rapidly toward the islands of Japan.</i>

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:02.330
Only half of us are in the picture.

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:05.050
You're right! How sad!

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.430
Wakabadai Station

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:15.200
Don't you think this is too 
much of a change in weather?

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:17.280
It's too fierce for a sudden shower.

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:24.280
Somebody come, and save me popo.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:34.820
More!

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:47.120
More!

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:52.680
Even more!

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:16.730
Wakabadai Station

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:25.060
Popo!

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:32.450
Popo...!

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:35.750
Popo... popo...!

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:45.690
You... Are you from the Field of Light?

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:48.490
No! Popo! Popo! Popo!

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.640
The cake here is supposed to be delicious.

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:56.400
Shall we go inside?

00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:59.370
I can feel Pollun close by mipo!

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:00.780
Really?

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:03.170
See? I knew he'd be at a bakery...

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.010
Pollun's somewhere over there mepo!

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:06.720
Are you serious?

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:08.470
Let's go over there.

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.120
Why?

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:22.330
Help popo...

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:26.360
I'm asking you why you're 
on the Field of Rainbows.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.370
Pollun!

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:37.110
You two...

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:40.210
Are you the ones?

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:44.130
He's... he's from Dotsuku Zone mepo!

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.920
It can't be...!

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:49.400
He couldn't be from Dotsuku Zone!

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:50.550
Popo...!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:51.830
Popo... popo!

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.810
What are you going to do?

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:07.200
What's going on?

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.500
But this is our chance.

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:24.130
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:18.910
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:21.780
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:25.660
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:29.060
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.490
Go back to where you came from!

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:36.870
So, you are the ones.

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:49.430
Popo!

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:56.240
Hold on tight, Pollun!

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.370
What kind of power is that mepo?

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:00.220
It's unbelievable power mipo.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:05.700
Don't let go, Pollun.

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:06.780
Popo.

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:16.490
Popo!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.160
Pollun!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:22.230
Popo...

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:25.490
Pollun?

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:29.550
What are you doing to this little kid?

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:30.660
How cruel!

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:32.650
It's unforgivable!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:33.650
White?

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:37.560
Black Thunder!

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:40.020
White Thunder!

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:54.660
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:57.690
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:02.590
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:01.890
He's gone.

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:03.330
I was so scared popo.

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:05.330
I thought it was all over popo.

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:07.240
You're all right now.

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:09.160
Popo...

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:30.630
Nagisa! Let's play together popo!

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:33.600
You sure have a lot of energy, don't you?

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:36.310
Considering you were bawling 
your eyes out earlier.

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:38.870
I forget already popo.

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:42.450
Don't you have to go back to Honoka's 
house where Mipple is mepo?

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:44.160
I'll go home eventually popo.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:46.040
Never mind that... Let's play popo.

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:47.740
I'll even play with you, Mepple popo.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.080
You'll even play with me mepo...

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.540
What do you mean by that mepo!!

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:53.870
Save me, Nagisa.

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:55.720
Mepple is picking on me popo.

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:57.550
Mepo!

00:21:57.550 --> 00:21:59.250
Who's picking on you mepo?

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:00.520
Try and catch me popo.

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:02.180
Mepo!

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:07.660
Come back here!

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:14.110
I'm happy to be living together again, but...

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:16.900
This is impossible!

00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:17.930
Popo...?

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:19.770
Mepo!

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.930
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.180
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.190
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:55.320
It's hot!

00:23:55.320 --> 00:23:56.440
It's so hot!

00:23:56.440 --> 00:23:59.440
Why can't you be more like 
Pollun and the others?

00:23:59.440 --> 00:24:01.590
Pollun's saying strange things again.

00:24:01.590 --> 00:24:03.420
What is that red bridge?

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:04.980
Does that mean something 
is starting all over again?

00:24:04.980 --> 00:24:06.060
These signs...?

00:24:06.060 --> 00:24:08.030
Is it the power of darkness?

00:24:09.660 --> 00:24:12.160
"REGINE APPEARS! 
WE'VE HAD ENOUGH OF THIS ALREADY"

00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:14.760
By the way, have you made any progress 
on your summer vacation homework?

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:18.800
I'm the type who works better under pressure.
